meta {
  name: 5. Get Driver Code
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/driver-code
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

script:post-response {
  bru.setEnvVar("driverCode", res.body.data.driverCode);
}

docs {
  Requires the driver to already be DL-verified (step 3 returned VERIFIED, or a VAHN admin
  approved the manual upload from step 4) — otherwise this still works but the driver won't be
  linkable by a truck owner yet.

  Generates a code on first call if the driver doesn't have one yet; returns the same code on
  later calls. This is the code a driver shares with a truck owner so the owner can link them
  to a fleet — see "Link Driver by Code" in the plutus-api reference collection (fleet-side,
  not part of this driver-facing flow).
}
